  "prefLabel": "Env-A 3203.02 Account",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 3203.02 “Account” means the place in the NOx allowance tracking system where allowances are recorded, either:\n\n(a) A compliance account, where allowances are held by a budget source;\n\n(b) An overdraft account, where allowances are held by a group of budget sources; or\n\n(c) A general account, where allowances are held by any person.\n\nSource. #11001, eff 1-1-16; ss by #14632, eff 6-25-26, EXPIRES: 6-25-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a3200.html"
}
